<Mod id="b9f9bac5-c621-4458-bccf-c9ef80b2769f" version="6">
  <Properties>
    <Name>The Golden Pavilion Wonder</Name>
    <Teaser>Located in Idyllic surrounds in Kyoto, Japan, Kinkaku-ji</Teaser>
    <Description>One year on from the initial release of the Golden Pavilion, my first ever mod, it has been redone with a new icon, credit to sukritact, and support for Spanish language, my first wonder to do so, credit to elProfesor. [NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Located in Idyllic syrrounds in Kyoto, Japan, Kinkaku-ji is a large temple with the exterior walls coated in gold leaf. [NEWLINE][NEWLINE] [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT] Changelog:[ENDCOLOR]Added support for Spanish language[NEWLINE]New Icon</Description>
    <Authors>Pouakai, sukritact,</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>ambrox62, Moriboe, elProfesor</SpecialThanks>
